{"4164520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Champions Stable: Equestrian Dynasty", "steam_appid": 4164520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our growing Community!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/60ed3c72af5a192369557dbb8a59ab8a.avif?t=1785744397\" width=614 height=186 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAMPIONS STABLE: EQUESTRIAN DYNASTY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world of horse racing has been reinvented.</strong><br><strong>Champions Stable</strong> combines the depth of a <strong>strategic management sim</strong> with the adrenaline of <strong>first-person racing</strong>, featuring visuals that set <i>a new standard for the entire genre</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your future champion, plan your strategy:   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Every decision you make changes the fate of your stables.</strong></i> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/dd2c2d5ca33fe594abfbe1aeb4289846.avif?t=1785744397\" width=1557 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/02076d2defa4bd48deda5ae5b95f6e0c.poster.avif?t=1785744397\" width=800 height=355 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/02076d2defa4bd48deda5ae5b95f6e0c.webm?t=1785744397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built in Unreal Engine, Champions Stable pushes visual fidelity far beyond traditional management sims. Horses, tracks, and environments are rendered with a level of detail that makes every race feel tangible. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Muscle movement, terrain, weather, and animations work together to create races that look and feel authentic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/c3cde647af6b56931c6e74386590e21d.avif?t=1785744397\" width=1557 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/831aa54b2274c034d8fd699ea22faf43.avif?t=1785744397\" width=800 height=355 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You manage your stables, then take control of the track. Training, resource allocation, stamina management, and race strategy all matter once the gate opens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success is about timing, positioning, and knowing when to push your horse to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/2b0287e64e3a6d1ad2da73e74a717134.avif?t=1785744397\" width=1557 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/00d8154ab1d1e5b54d5be92545c7a663.poster.avif?t=1785744397\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/00d8154ab1d1e5b54d5be92545c7a663.webm?t=1785744397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/00d8154ab1d1e5b54d5be92545c7a663.mp4?t=1785744397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a real connection with your horses through care, training, and exploration. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step away from competition and ride freely in a large third-person open world filled with landscapes, hidden spots, and side activities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture your journey with a fully featured Photo Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/d2fc68af2b6b450e6bac58dacefde302.avif?t=1785744397\" width=1557 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/05682e1bfd09f8dcd3171841c52fe94d.poster.avif?t=1785744397\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/05682e1bfd09f8dcd3171841c52fe94d.webm?t=1785744397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/05682e1bfd09f8dcd3171841c52fe94d.mp4?t=1785744397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your operation from the ground up. Upgrade facilities, invest in better infrastructure, and develop a breeding program built on genetics and long-term planning. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage health, finances, and reputation as you turn your stables into a legacy that lasts generations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CHAMPIONS STABLE: EQUESTRIAN DYNASTY</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world of horse racing has been reinvented.</strong><br><strong>Champions Stable</strong> combines the depth of a <strong>strategic management sim</strong> with the adrenaline of <strong>first-person racing</strong>, featuring visuals that set <i>a new standard for the entire genre</i>