</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Success is about timing, positioning, and knowing when to push your horse to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/2b0287e64e3a6d1ad2da73e74a717134.avif?t=1785744397\" width=1557 height=100 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/00d8154ab1d1e5b54d5be92545c7a663.poster.avif?t=1785744397\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/00d8154ab1d1e5b54d5be92545c7a663.webm?t=1785744397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/00d8154ab1d1e5b54d5be92545c7a663.mp4?t=1785744397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a real connection with your horses through care, training, and exploration. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step away from competition and ride freely in a large third-person open world filled with landscapes, hidden spots, and side activities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture your journey with a fully featured Photo Mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/d2fc68af2b6b450e6bac58dacefde302.avif?t=1785744397\" width=1557 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4164520/extras/05682e1bfd09f8dcd3171841c52fe94d.poster.avif?t=1785744397\" width=800 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/